# HOUSE STYLE GUIDE — "Aztlan structure × Halliburton palette"

Forensic result of 7 templates (KLA, Mitsubishi, Gaztransport, Data Centers, Ingevity, M&A FEMSA, Think-cell) measured with PowerPoint COM (effective, not inherited-null values) + chart XML. All numbers are inches / points on a **13.333 × 7.5 in (16:9)** slide.
Source data: `renders/<deck>/slides.jsonl`, `masters/*.json`, `charts_all.json`, per-slide tables in `specs/*.md`, images in `renders/<deck>/slide_NN.png`.

> Decision recorded: the Team 9 deck is **content reference only** (user dislikes its format). Format comes from the user's own templates. The user's cover image (red wave) fixes the brand direction = Halliburton red.

