## 1. Grid, margins, zones (System A, verified on KLA "General" layout)

```
x:  0.575 ─────────────── content ─────────────── 12.877      (left margin 0.575, right margin 0.456)
y:  0.313  top rule (full width 0.565→12.828)
    0.533  TITLE   (h 0.454, w 9.83)            ← never wider than 9.83 (logo zone x≥10.4)
    0.989  SUBTITLE (h 0.286)
    1.30–1.45  content top  (1.446 when subtitle present, 1.308 for FinancialStatements)
    …      content area  : 12.30 w × 5.33 h  (y 1.446 → 6.78)
    6.78   content bottom limit
    6.828  footer-left small text (9 pt) ·  6.951 SOURCE line (centered, 10 pt italic) · page number (right)
```
* Two-column split used everywhere: left x0.575–6.417 (w5.842) | right x7.035–12.877 (w5.842); gutter 0.62.
* "Text + 2 stacked charts": text col x0.575 w7.095 | chart col x8.085 w4.79 (header y1.446, rule y1.817, unit label y1.816, chart y2.107 h2.0; second block header y4.198).
* Bottom-aligned content rule: nothing between y6.78 and the source line.
* Dense but never cramped: min gap between blocks 0.15–0.25 in.

## 2. Typography scale (measured by character volume across 130+ slides)

| Role | Size | Weight | Color |
|---|---|---|---|
| Cover title | 40 | regular | white |
| Cover subtitle / date | 24 | regular | white |
| Slide title | **28** | regular (A) / bold (B) | black (A) |
| Slide subtitle ("so-what" sentence) | **16** | regular | deep accent (#221D55 in Aztlan → HAL deep red) |
| Block header (chart/table header) | **16 bold** | bold | #404040 or black, with 1 pt rule under |
| Body bullets | **14** (text-only slides) / **12** (text next to charts) / **11** (dense slides) | regular, **bold lead-in** | black; key numbers **bold accent**; risks **bold red #C00000** |
| Sub-bullets | 12 / 11 | regular | black (hollow-circle bullet) |
| Chart unit label ("Amounts in $m") | 12 | *italic* | black |
| Chart axis / data labels | 10–12 (category 12, data 9–11) | regular; totals bold | black / white inside dark bars |
| Table body | **11** (10 for 12+ cols; 8–9 only in appendix) | regular | black |
| Table header | 11 bold | bold | white on navy→(HAL) fill |
| Source / footnote | **10 *italic*, centered** | italic | black |
| Page number | 11 | regular | accent |
| Footer-left small | 9 | regular | light grey |

Rules: one font family (Arial). Body is **justified** in text-heavy slides (Aztlan) — use left-aligned in narrow columns (<4 in) to avoid rivers. Never below 9 pt except footnotes (8 pt, System B).

Text-emphasis grammar (very consistent in the user's decks): `**Bold lead-in:**` + accent-colored bold for the key claim + normal text for support; one red bold clause per bullet max for "risk/negative".

