## 9. Evidence slides (Bloomberg / company images the user values)

User instruction: *use the images the company and reports provide*. Rules:
1. Prefer **native-resolution images** extracted from the PDFs (`08_Assets/company_images/`), not page renders. Placed size must keep ≥150 dpi: image px ÷ placed inches ≥ 150 → a 773 px-wide photo can be at most **5.1 in** wide; 892 px → 5.9 in; 2161 px → 14 in (full-bleed OK).
2. Photos used as: right-hand 4.3–5.0 in column image (full-height of content area, cropped), or 3-up strip at the bottom (h 1.4 in). Caption = 10 pt italic below, `Source: Halliburton Q2-26 Investor Presentation`.
3. Company charts (e.g., debt maturity, ROCE, cash-flow) → **rebuild natively** with the same numbers; cite the company deck in the source line. Keep the original page as backup only.
4. Bloomberg Terminal screenshots → crop to the relevant panel, place at ≤ 6 in wide with 0.5 pt border #7F7F7F and the caption "Source: Bloomberg (DRSK, 11-Sep-2026)". Dark screenshots appear on **at most 1 slide per section**, framed in a white card so they read as exhibits.
5. Licensing: BI/Bloomberg reports state *"exclusive use of DIEGO MARTINEZ … not for redistribution"* — cite, do not republish the full report; keep screenshots as classroom exhibits.

## 10. Quality gate (apply before declaring any slide done)
- [ ] Title ≤ 1 line @28 pt, is a sentence with a verb and a number or direction.
- [ ] Subtitle 16 pt, deep-red, one line, states the "so what".
- [ ] All text boxes inside x 0.575–12.877, y 1.30–6.78; nothing touches the logo zone (x ≥ 10.4, y ≤ 1.3).
- [ ] ≤ 3 text sizes in the body area; no text < 10 pt (footnote 8–9 allowed); no justified text in columns < 4 in.
- [ ] Max 1 chart pair or 1 chart + 1 text column per slide (never > 2 charts + table).
- [ ] Every number traceable in `FACT_BASE.md` (ID in notes) and source line present.
- [ ] Series colors in the palette order; one highlight color only.
- [ ] Render to PNG (PowerPoint COM `Slide.Export`) and visually inspect every slide; run `tools/ppt_forensics.ps1` on the output and diff against this guide (fonts must all be Arial; sizes ∈ {8,9,10,11,12,14,16,18,24,28,40}).
